# Which GitHub Release this site is deployed from.
#
# The first non-comment line is the release tag. The deploy workflow downloads
# that Release's assets and publishes them inside the Pages artifact, so the
# browser reads them same-origin -- Release asset bytes are not fetchable from
# a browser directly (no CORS on the signed redirect target).
#
# Changing this line and pushing to main is the whole deployment: the commit
# triggers the workflow, and the diff records which results went live and when.
#
# Leave it empty to deploy the site with no data; the file picker still works.
#
# To preview another Release without changing what is deployed, run the
# workflow by hand with its `release` input -- that overrides this for one run
# and does not persist.

